"""
IQ Quub-style puzzle game (tkinter, no extra packages needed)

Goal : place all 10 coloured pieces on the 7x13 board.
       Pieces cannot cover the grey/white blocks and cannot overlap.
       The 10 pieces fill every free cell exactly.

Challenges : pick one of the 90 booklet challenges from the drop-down
             (Starter 1-18, Junior 19-36, Expert 37-54, Master 55-72,
             Wizard 73-90). Pre-placed pieces are locked (shown with a
             dark outline). "Free play" starts with an empty board.

Controls
  Left mouse drag ... pick up / move / drop a piece (snaps to grid)
  Right click / R ... rotate piece (under cursor or being dragged)
  F ................. flip piece (under cursor or being dragged)
  Buttons ........... Reset, Undo (removes the last placed piece),
                      Hint (places one piece correctly), Solution
  Timer ............. Starts automatically when a piece is first moved;
                      stops when solved; resets when you pick a new
                      challenge or press the puzzle Reset

Run:  python iq_quub.py
"""
